From 28a43739e0945c385e7550d421f6840640030f37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 08 Nov 2026 08:21:15 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] dt-bindings: media: apple,prores: Add T6050

The M5 Pro/Max ProRes engine (J716s ADT /arm-io/apr0, compatible apr,n0)
has the register windows the T6041 has: the engine, the 16 MiB wrapper
and a third, auxiliary window at engine + 0xc0000. It has one DART
stream and two interrupts, and its SCODEC power state is also its reset
(the ADT's function-device_reset), so resets is required for it. The
T8140 node keeps its two windows.

The compatible takes the "apple,t6050-prores", "apple,prores" form the
integration tree uses for every SoC it added after the T8140.

Signed-off-by: Rolando Trevino <rolotrealanis@gmail.com>
---
 .../bindings/media/apple,prores.yaml          | 34 ++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 33 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,prores.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,prores.yaml
index 07afac17ef2e..b34fd15bba4e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,prores.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,prores.yaml
@@ -14,19 +14,30 @@ description: |
   descriptors in a DMA ring; the engine signals completion with an
   interrupt. It has no firmware. Its power domain also resets it.
 
+  The T6050 (M5 Pro/Max) engine has a third, auxiliary register window
+  beside the engine and wrapper windows, as the T6041 does.
+
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: apple,t8140-prores
+    oneOf:
+      - const: apple,t8140-prores
+      - items:
+          - const: apple,t6050-prores
+          - const: apple,prores
 
   reg:
+    minItems: 2
     items:
       - description: Engine registers
       - description: Wrapper registers
+      - description: Auxiliary registers
 
   reg-names:
+    minItems: 2
     items:
       - const: core
       - const: wrapper
+      - const: aux
 
   interrupts:
     minItems: 1
@@ -58,6 +69,27 @@ required:
   - iommus
   - power-domains
 
+allOf:
+  - if:
+      properties:
+        compatible:
+          contains:
+            const: apple,t6050-prores
+    then:
+      properties:
+        reg:
+          minItems: 3
+        reg-names:
+          minItems: 3
+      required:
+        - resets
+    else:
+      properties:
+        reg:
+          maxItems: 2
+        reg-names:
+          maxItems: 2
+
 additionalProperties: false
 
 examples:
-- 
